    {
      "number": 44,
      "category": "",
      "title": "晉書卷四十四·盧志傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064"
